          "author": "Pomelody",
          "copyright": "Pomelody",
          "description": "Dive into a world where orchestral instruments become storytellers, charming little listeners with their unique voice and engaging stories. \n\nThese audio stories help children explore a wide range of emotions while developing their active listening skills and focus.\n\nThis album enhances your child's musical potential, provides fantastic entertainment, and nurtures their musical and aesthetic sensitivity. \nEnjoy a rich auditory experience that fosters a lifelong appreciation for music and storytelling.  \n\nYour child will get to know a diverse group of orchestral instruments, including strings, woodwind, brass, percussion, and others.  \n\nTrack Listing:   \n\n1. Diana the Mermaid’s Songs [Violin]\n2. A Day Without Breakfast [Viola]\n3. Haha and Buha [Cello]\n4. Envy Thieves [Double Bass]\n5. Frederiko the Mouse [Flute] \n6. Abbie the Duck’s Journey [Oboe] \n7. Johnny, the Shepherd Boy [Clarinet] \n8. The Cubs' First Spring [Bassoon] \n9. Baired the Scared [Trumpet] \n10. Krokus the Dragon Lights the Stars [Trombone] \n11. Pixie and the French Horn [French Horn] \n12. Irena the Hippo [Tuba] \n13. The Emperor's New Clothes [Xylophone, Marimba] \n14. Boby’s Sailing out of the Harbour [Harp]",
